From: Julian Cooper <115541810+Juliansgith@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:12:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/52] Build with /EHs so Lua errors can unwind through the VM

The recovered Lua VM (lua/LuaObject.cpp) raises script errors as C++
exceptions (lua_RuntimeError from luaG_errormsg) out of functions declared
extern "C". Under the default /EHsc the compiler may assume extern "C"
functions never throw and drop the handlers around them, so in Release a Lua
error unwound past LuaCallProtected and every other handler and terminated
the process. Debug builds happened to keep the handlers. /EHs
(ExceptionHandling=SyncCThrow) keeps them in every configuration.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit 4e33524e9e2eb74d6b32011539d171042d351143)
(cherry picked from commit ff295da061295a860c27f9ad96ff3487b41de360)
---
 src/sdk/main.vcxproj | 20 ++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 20 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/sdk/main.vcxproj b/src/sdk/main.vcxproj
index ee5f9068..26b80169 100644
--- a/src/sdk/main.vcxproj
+++ b/src/sdk/main.vcxproj
@@ -183,6 +183,11 @@
       <ConformanceMode>true</ConformanceMode>
       <LanguageStandard>stdcpp20</LanguageStandard>
       <LanguageStandard_C>stdc17</LanguageStandard_C>
+      <!-- /EHs, not the default /EHsc: the Lua VM (lua\LuaObject.cpp) raises script errors as C++
+           exceptions from functions declared extern "C" (luaG_errormsg, luaD_call, ...). Under /EHsc
+           the optimizer may assume those never throw and drop the catch in LuaCallProtected,
+           so in Release any Lua error unwound past every protected call and killed the process. -->
+      <ExceptionHandling>SyncCThrow</ExceptionHandling>
       <AdditionalOptions>/MP4 /FS %(AdditionalOptions)</AdditionalOptions>
       <DisableSpecificWarnings>4073;4244;4273;4834;4996;%(DisableSpecificWarnings)</DisableSpecificWarnings>
       <AdditionalIncludeDirectories>$(FafFfmpegRoot)\include;$(FafRepoRoot)src\sdk;$(FafRepoRoot)dependencies\LuaPlus_Build1081\Src\LuaPlus\include;$(FafRepoRoot)dependencies\boost_1_34_1;$(FafRepoRoot)dependencies\zlib-1.2.3\include;$(FafRepoRoot)dependencies\wxWindows-2.4.2\include;$(FafRepoRoot)dependencies\wxWindows-2.4.2\lib\mswu;$(Wm3IncludePath);%(AdditionalIncludeDirectories)</AdditionalIncludeDirectories>
@@ -230,6 +235,11 @@ if exist "$(FafRunDir)" if exist "$(TargetDir)$(TargetName).pdb" xcopy /D /Y /Q
       <ConformanceMode>true</ConformanceMode>
       <LanguageStandard>stdcpp20</LanguageStandard>
       <LanguageStandard_C>stdc17</LanguageStandard_C>
